# Transactional hero (Rollout)

When editing landing/product heroes for SEO/conversion, follow the full checklist in **`HERO-TRANSACTIONAL-PATTERN.md`** at the repository root (align title, h1, hero img alt, og/twitter, JSON-LD; use `hero--fun-dives` or `hero--transactional`; mirror CSS in `style.css` and `style.min.css`).

Reference implementation: `en/day-trips/fun-dives/index.html` and commit `da0c50cd`.
